; ZX Spectrum +2A/+3 system variables at #5B00 for the Xpeccy+ debugger: the
; names and addresses of the ZX Spectrum +3 manual, chapter 8 part 25. Part of
; Xpeccy+, MIT license.
;
; Converted to the Debugger's text format on 2026-11-20 (docs/debugger-format.md):
; BANK:ADDR NAME SIZE - a RAM cell of that bank, at the CPU address it has at
; #4000-#7FFF, there while a ROM with names of its namespace is in the machine.
05:5B00 P3ROM0.SWAP 16
05:5B10 P3ROM0.STOO 17
05:5B21 P3ROM0.YOUNGER 9
05:5B2A P3ROM0.REGNUOY 16
05:5B3A P3ROM0.ONERR 24
05:5B52 P3ROM0.OLDHL 2
05:5B54 P3ROM0.OLDBC 2
05:5B56 P3ROM0.OLDAF 2
05:5B58 P3ROM0.TARGET 2
05:5B5A P3ROM0.RETADDR 2
05:5B5C P3ROM0.BANKM 1
05:5B5D P3ROM0.RAMRST 1
05:5B5E P3ROM0.RAMERR 1
05:5B5F P3ROM0.BAUD 2
05:5B61 P3ROM0.SERFL 2
05:5B63 P3ROM0.COL 1
05:5B64 P3ROM0.WIDTH 1
05:5B65 P3ROM0.TVPARS 1
05:5B66 P3ROM0.FLAGS3 1
05:5B67 P3ROM0.BANK678 1
05:5B68 P3ROM0.XLOC 1
05:5B69 P3ROM0.YLOC 1
05:5B6A P3ROM0.OLDSP 2
05:5B6C P3ROM0.SYNRET 2
05:5B6E P3ROM0.LASTV 5
